@startuml
title UML state machine diagram - Farm Management System

[*] --> SignIn : [Enter credentials]
state SignIn <<choice>>
SignIn --> MainArea : [Successful login]
SignIn --> Error : [Invalid credentials]

MainArea --> MarketConditions : [Select market conditions]
MainArea --> PestControlHelp : [Select pest control help]
MainArea --> SoilInfo : [Provide soil information]
MainArea --> Location : [Provide location]

state MarketConditions <<choice>>
MarketConditions --> MarketReport : [View market report]

state PestControlHelp <<choice>>
PestControlHelp --> Techniques : [View pest control techniques]

state SoilInfo <<choice>>
SoilInfo --> SuitableCrops : [Provide soil-related suggestions]

state Location <<choice>>
Location --> LabourDetails : [Display labour availability details]
Location --> WeatherInsights : [Offer weather insights]

MainArea --> Continue : [Continue using the service]
SignOut --> EndSession : [User logs out]

SignIn --> MainArea_2 : [Successful login (duplicate transition removed)]
SignIn --> Error_2 : [Invalid credentials (duplicate transition removed)]

MainArea --> MarketConditions_2 : [Select market conditions (duplicate transition removed)]
MainArea --> PestControlHelp_2 : [Select pest control help (duplicate transition removed)]
MainArea --> SoilInfo_2 : [Provide soil information (duplicate transition removed)]
MainArea --> Location_2 : [Provide location (duplicate transition removed)]

MarketConditions --> MarketReport_2 : [View market report (duplicate transition removed)]
PestControlHelp --> Techniques_2 : [View pest control techniques (duplicate transition removed)]
SoilInfo --> SuitableCrops_2 : [Provide soil-related suggestions (duplicate transition removed)]
Location --> LabourDetails_2 : [Display labour availability details (duplicate transition removed)]
Location --> WeatherInsights_2 : [Offer weather insights (duplicate transition removed)]

MainArea_2 --> Continue_2 : [Continue using the service (duplicate transition removed)]
SignOut --> EndSession_2 : [User logs out (duplicate transition removed)]

MainArea --> LoggedOut : [Logged out]
LoggedOut --> [*] : [Return to initial state]
@enduml
